msgctxt "185\t277"
msgid "What's up with those clothes, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "286\t409"
msgid "I'm actually heading up to Tokyo.\\nFor about a week."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "410\t464"
msgid "Whoa, really!?"
msgstr "Wow, davvero?"

msgctxt "465\t539"
msgid "That's awesome!\\nI'm coming, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540\t650"
msgid "Yeah! Take us with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704\t830"
msgid "Sorry, kids.\\nIt's not gonna be a vacation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "837\t968"
msgid "Your Uncle Kaz has some very\\nimportant business to take care of."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "982\t1171"
msgid "But while I'm gone, a new friend\\nis gonna come live here with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1478\t1538"
msgid "This is Saki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1539\t1650"
msgid "She's been through a lot,\\nso she has some trouble talking."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1703\t1861"
msgid "Her dad's hurt, too.\\nHe's in the hospital right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1862\t1986"
msgid "For the time being,\\nI told her she can stay here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2014\t2155"
msgid "So what do you say?\\nCan you make her feel at home?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2282\t2345"
msgid "Darn right we can!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2427\t2497"
msgid "Come on, Saki-chan!"
msgstr ""
